WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.562
Landolo e Cailcedrate mawɗo. Fedde leydi ndii.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.688
Nder daande gariiri ndin ɗon woodi leggal mawngal, ɓurɗum mawɓe fuu.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.400
Landolo wondi ɓiɗɗo gorko. O jooɗii e deerɗiraawo maako, ngam o halki ɓiɗɗo maako.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.734
Ndaa ndiyam. E ɗon!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.706
Ɓiɗɗo on ɗon nyaama. Landolo boo o walaa kooɗume.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.016
Wakkati go'o jemma, ɓiyum wari boowi haa leggal mawngal.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.650
Sey leggal ngal ummi. Go'o go'o ɗon ɓilla, ɗon nyaama.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.528
Landolo nyaami, o yetti leɗɗe mawɗe.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.210
Ɗu'um, nduu'um! Njoo'u yimre am.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.362
Koo ndeye nder nyalawma o ɗon maaya, lekki boo ɗon maaki. Ɓiɗɗo on ɓeydi mawnugo.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.234
Ɓaawo maajum, mo'o ɗon hayɗina. O tokki mo, o jaɓɓi mo.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.684
Min boo, hokke!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.208
Leggal ngal neldi go'o lekki.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.144
Ngaɗee leggal ngal ngam am!

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.600
O wurtini yimɓe ɗiɗo.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.712
Ammaa haakooji ɗi o wi'i ɓe ngaɗata, ɓe ngaddani ɗum.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:04.674
Leggal ngal fuɗɗiti wurtaago. Sey hendu wurti, tawi'en ɗon cembiɗɗi.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.212
Duule mawnde, njooɗee!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.272
Ɗuum waɗi nde leggal ngal laaɓti.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:37.666
Wakkati nde weelo mawɗo wari. Koo ɗume maayi, sey leɗɗe mawɗe ɗe nyaami gariiri.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.872
O wari o sujidani Landolo, o tori mo yaafuki.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.450
Goonga, Landolo. Naafon, leɗɗe mawɗe.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.482
Hakkilani leggal ngal. O hokkan'on ɗum.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.760
Caggal duuɓi ɗuuɗɗi, leɗɗe mawɗe boo ɗon haaje.
